n":{"first_line":305,"last_line":310,"source_commit":"80174f61e491db29f9921d0d3e54a59649419aa9","raw_quote":"(課上上/曰最)上由此愈竒寛　初南越文王遣其子嬰齊入¶\n宿衛(南越王胡薨謚文王嬰齊入/宿衛見十七卷建元元年)在長安取邯鄲樛氏¶\n女(取讀曰娶邯鄲屬趙/國師古曰樛居虯翻)生子興文王薨嬰齊立乃蔵其¶\n先武帝璽(趙佗自號南越武帝/李竒曰去其僣號)上書請立樛氏女為后¶\n興為嗣漢數使使者風諭嬰齊入朝(數所角翻師古曰/風讀曰諷諷諭令)¶\n(入/朝)嬰齊尚樂擅殺生自恣懼入見要用漢法比内諸侯¶","extraction_boundary":"從初南越文王至興為嗣，非整段原檔行文全取。"},"chapter_id":"c-zizhitongjian-020-han12","book_id":"b-zizhitongjian-020","work_id":"w-zizhitongjian","source_id":"s-zizhitongjian-020-han12"}],"sources":[{"chapter_id":"c-shiji-113-nanyue","work_id":"w-shiji","book_id":"b-shiji-113","source_id":"s-shiji113-nanyue","source":{"title":"史記／卷113","provider":"維基文庫","url":"https://zh.wikisource.org/wiki/史記/卷113","permalink":"https://zh.wikisource.org/w/index.php?title=史記/卷113&oldid=8735632","revision_id":8735632,"accessed_on":"2026-10-11","extent":"固定數位見證14段，末段索隱述贊分層。","image_verified":false,"rights":"古代原文；數位轉錄依維基文庫CC BY-SA 4.0，保留署名及固定版本。","license_url":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/","normalization":{"character_conversion":{},"editorial_readings":[],"extraction_note":"去header2及現代節標題，YL紀年模板僅去外殼保留原字。未核底本影像。","note":"索隱述贊另層，不混作正文。"}}},{"chapter_id":"c-zizhitongjian-020-han12","work_id":"w-zizhitongjian","book_id":"b-zizhitongjian-020","source_id":"s-zizhitongjian-020-han12","source":{"title":"資治通鑑卷二十（固定數位轉錄，版本標記待核）","provider":"Kanripo","url":"https://github.com/kanripo/KR2b0007/blob/80174f61e491db29f9921d0d3e54a59649419aa9/KR2b0007_020.txt","permalink":"https://github.com/kanripo/KR2b0007/blob/80174f61e491db29f9921d0d3e54a59649419aa9/KR2b0007_020.txt","revision_id":"80174f61e491db29f9921d0d3e54a59649419aa9","source_commit":"80174f61e491db29f9921d0d3e54a59649419aa9","source_blob_sha":"71c9f2f93a06f0869cbe807edf3f42524a9ea2a3","accessed_on":"2026-10-16","extent":"只錄初南越文王遣其子嬰齊入宿衛至興為嗣一段，作史記南越父子對讀；未錄全卷。","text_scope":"partial_chapter","included_sections":["南越文王與嬰齊、樛氏女及興"],"image_verified":false,"rights":"古代正文及古注；保留Kanripo數位轉錄與固定提交來源歸屬。","license_url":"https://www.k